---
title: Reading tasks
---
sequenceDiagram
  %% Participants attach by directive: sequence diagrams have no classes.
  %% slarti: attach user user
  %% slarti: attach api todo.api
  %% slarti: alias store db
  %% slarti: attach store store
  %% slarti: ignore api -> user a reply, which depicts no relation
  %% slarti: ignore store -> api a reply, which depicts no relation
  actor user as User
  participant api as API
  participant store as Task store
  autonumber
  user->>api: uses
  activate api
  loop every list
    api->>+store: reads tasks
    store-->>-api: rows
  end
  Note over api,store: one query per list
  api-->>user: the lists
  deactivate api
